{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sugar Sling Showdown, a vibrant Candyland adventure, players wield their tongues to build, grapple, fling, and duel in a playful candy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Unique Tongue Mechanics: Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/TongueSSS.gif?t=1746171301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Nurture and Build: Nurturing rescued babies that'd determine the well being and development of Toffee Town adds a distinct flavor to a simplified colony sim.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/Nurture.gif?t=1746171301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Co-op mode: Work on Toffee Town together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/Action.gif?t=1746171301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Party game modes: Challenge your friends to different pvp, pve game modes and assert dominance in the candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/Party.gif?t=1746171301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Sweet fantasy: A distinct flavor of candy and veggie built world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/ColonySim.gif?t=1746171301\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687710?t=1746171301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687710?t=1746171301","capsule_image":